  - line: 16
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_location: Zar'Vokh / SPIRE-9, within a hollow planetary shell and its jurisdictional corridors"
  - line: 17
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_participants: Geralt; Oreck; Kyh; coherent Luminaire; Violet; Legal Sentinel; Enforcement Constructs; Hybrid Observer (voice beyond the final door)"
  - line: 18
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: Survive Zar'Vokh's classification and procedural traps without making binding declarations."
  - line: 19
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_boundary_evidence: Arrival through the Shadow Null Ingress creates a physical, procedural, and dramatic reset from null-space into Zar'Vokh."
  - line: 20
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_continuity: Zar'Vokh is explicitly SPIRE-9: a network/spire node and jurisdictional procedural system physically expressed within a hollow planetary shell."
  - line: 21
    type: narration
    text: "The source explicitly says it is not a planet."
  - line: 22
    type: narration
    text: "The Hybrid Observer is a governing entity/system within Zar'Vokh and is not automatically identical to Zar'Vokh itself."
  - line: 23
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_presentation: First contact, environmental diagnosis, procedural traversal, and legal-threat escalation"
  - line: 24
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_cutscene_purpose: Define Zar'Vokh as an administrative reality system rather than an ordinary planetary destination."
  - line: 25
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_hidden/unshown_intervals: Corridor traversal has no stated duration and supplies no calendar evidence."
  - line: 26
