  - line: 32
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.luminaire: Presently coherent, conversational, distinct from the Applicator, and able to transmit an ancient Architect clause through Geralt."
  - line: 33
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.applicator: Prior active head-Applicator state remains unresolved and unauthenticated; Chapter 052 does not invoke it."
  - line: 34
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.zaron: Absent and unresolved."
  - line: 35
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.oreck: Alive, armorless, burned and untreated, cleaver-equipped, and serving as the party's practical guide through intention traps."
  - line: 36
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.kyh: Active navigator using shadow-weaving for procedural shortcuts."
  - line: 37
    type: narration
    text: "Zar'Vokh applies the persistent state MARK APPLIED: UNREGISTERED ACTOR."
  - line: 38
    type: narration
    text: "U-779."
  - line: 39
    type: narration
    text: "TRACKING ACTIVE."
  - line: 40
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.vek'tar: Absent; terminal state remains unresolved."
  - line: 41
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.kaelen_objective: Kaelen remains absent; the original recruitment objective is displaced and unfulfilled."
  - line: 42
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.five_mikas: All five remain last-established as active from Chapter 051, but Chapter 052 directly restages only Violet here."
  - line: 43
