    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.federation_clocks: Expired and unresolved; no consequence or reset."
  - line: 51
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.campaign_arithmetic: Two completed intervention targets; Zar'Vokh is the active third operation."
  - line: 52
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.network_topology: SPIRE-9 is a jurisdictional layer, procedural system, and network node within the wider Spire Network."
  - line: 53
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.node_gamma: Absent; not identified with Zar'Vokh, the Hybrid Observer, or its corruption."
  - line: 54
